# Car Rental Management System — Windsurf Rules

## Stack
- PHP: 8.4
- Framework: Laravel 13
- Frontend: Blade, Tailwind CSS v4, Alpine.js
- Auth: Laravel Fortify
- UI Components: Livewire/Flux v2

## Roles & Route Prefixes
- admin    → /admin/
- agent    → /agent/
- customer → /customer/

## Services (app/Services/)
- AvailabilityService  — check car availability by date range
- PricingService       — calculate rental price, discount, deposit
- PenaltyService       — late return, fuel, damage penalties
- ContractService      — generate contract number, create/close contracts
- ReportService        — daily/monthly summaries, car utilization

## Business Rules

### Late Return Penalty
- Per day: daily_rate × 0.5

### Fuel Penalty (based on difference: out → in)
- full → 3/4 : daily_rate × 0.10
- 3/4  → 1/2 : daily_rate × 0.20
- 1/2  → 1/4 : daily_rate × 0.30
- 1/4  → empty: daily_rate × 0.40

### Contract Number Format
- CNT-YYYY-XXXXX  (e.g. CNT-2025-00001, auto-increment)

## Database Tables
users, customers, cars, reservations, contracts,
penalties, payments, car_maintenance, activity_logs

## Enums
- cars.fuel_type:        petrol, diesel, electric, hybrid
- cars.transmission:     manual, automatic
- cars.status:           available, rented, maintenance, reserved
- reservations.status:   pending, approved, active, completed, cancelled
- contracts.fuel_level:  full, three_quarters, half, quarter, empty
- penalties.type:        late_return, damage, fuel, other
- payments.type:         deposit, rental, penalty, refund
- payments.method:       cash, card, transfer
- car_maintenance.type:  routine, repair, inspection

## Currency
- Default: AZN

## Key Conventions
- Use Form Requests for all CRUD validation
- Log every create/update/delete in activity_logs
- Use SoftDeletes on: customers, cars, reservations
- PDF contracts via barryvdh/laravel-dompdf
- DataTables via yajra/laravel-datatables-oracle
